    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "顺利就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "有什么想说的就直接说，别吞吞吐吐的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "没什么......只是觉得......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "想辞职了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "没，只是对罗德岛的这份工作加深了一点认识......大概吧，一点点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "哈哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "有干劲是好事啊，既然你还有干劲，那现在就去清点一下医疗物资的消耗情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "做两份记录，一份给办事处留档，一份明早递交给本地政府。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "......好，我这就去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "四天后"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "东西都收拾好了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苏苏洛",
      "text": "嗯，没问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "来了来了来了，差一点没赶上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "你干什么去了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "啊，这不是苏苏洛小姐让我帮忙买东西吗，我都买来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "这么多？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苏苏洛",
      "text": "咳......这些是给凯尔希医生的书，这个是给嘉维尔医生的工艺品。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "这是什么，零食？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苏苏洛",
      "text": "那个是给博士的......小礼物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "博士？就是......那个博士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "总之，替我向凯尔希医生和博士问好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苏苏洛",
      "text": "好的，没问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "最后祝你们一路顺风，安全抵达。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苏苏洛",
      "text": "谢谢您，我们下次再见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "他们走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "好了，回去干活吧，还有一大堆报告要写。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "......嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "我是不是也该找个工作机会去罗德岛本舰看看呢......感觉都是些很奇妙的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "行啊，但是，先把自己手上的活儿干完再琢磨吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
